==Notes==
Due to rounding, to calculate the pet level needed for a specific attribute bonus, use the following formula

Floor((TargetBonus - 0.5) / 0.08)

For example, to have an extra perk (25 bonus points): 24.5 / 0.08 = 306.25, rounded up 307

